            "content": "<p>At Pathways Co-op powered by OEO, we’re here to help private schools provide a complete, high-quality education for their students. Whether you're looking to expand your course offerings or provide Cooperative Education opportunities, partnering with us makes it simple and seamless.<br/><br/>We allow schools to offer co-op <strong>without hiring a co-op teacher, managing placements, or navigating Ministry compliance</strong>.</p>",
