            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fccf18fd-6fbd-452b-b984-fb91895d3c74.png",
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Purchase Seats for our Cooperative Education Course",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Give your students the opportunity to explore career paths through Cooperative Education!</p><p>Co-op is a valuable experience for high school students, but it can be challenging for private schools to manage due to logistical and administrative hurdles. That’s where we come in. OEO takes care of <strong>everything</strong>, including:</p><ul><li>On-site visits</li><li>Ministry reporting (e.g., ONSIS data collection, report cards)</li><li>Personalized support for your students</li></ul><p>Partnering with us is cost-effective and efficient. Purchase a block of <strong>10+ Co-op seats</strong> for your school and let us do the heavy lifting.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_zTFYWc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Mar_28_2025_11_09_20_AM.png",
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Fill Gaps in Your Curriculum",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Not every private school can offer every course every year—that’s where OEO can help. Whether it’s due to low enrollment or a lack of specialized instructors, we provide <strong>individual courses</strong> for students who need them.</p><p>We handle:</p><ul><li>Teaching</li><li>Grading</li><li>Ministry reporting (e.g., ONSIS compliance)</li></ul><p>Our flexible online platform ensures your students can access the courses they need to succeed.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
